outcomes:
A step added to .github/workflows/tests.yml but not to the script;
the build dropped from the script; the Node floor drifting from CI;
the design-lock guard losing its step or its git history.

O1  A feedback link (lens, or idealArc with feedback) opens the feedback;
a link with mode=review opens the review; a bare idealArc link opens
neither.

O1  Starting, stopping and finishing processing lead to the readout;
from there the next Take, a pause, or "sign up to send" (and on to
review) are expected steps.

O1  The same project gets the setup and helper words the page just read;
another project (or none) gets null.
O2  Once the short window has passed, the Lab gets null and reads again.
